---
// Compact, single-row Spit-Up Society promo banner — for pages that don't
// already have the full pitch (see Huddle.astro, the homepage's full
// section-with-bullet-list-and-photo version of this same pitch). Built
// 2026-08-31 for /merch and /podcast specifically: both had zero Spit-Up
// Society mention despite being high-intent traffic (people already buying
// or already listening). Deliberately evergreen copy, not tied to any one
// episode or promo, so it doesn't go stale and need upkeep — the timely,
// "we just dropped an episode" push belongs in the newsletter/social copy
// instead, not baked into a permanent site banner.
---
<section class="spitup-banner">
  <div class="container spitup-banner-inner">
    <div class="spitup-banner-copy">
      <span class="spitup-banner-badge">Live Q&amp;A &middot; Twice a Month</span>
      <p class="spitup-banner-text">
        Bring your real questions to John and Mike, live — join <strong>The Spit-Up Society</strong> for $5/mo, cancel anytime.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href="/join/spit-up-society" class="btn btn-primary spitup-banner-cta">Join the Spit-Up Society</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .spitup-banner {
    background: var(--bg-dark-raised);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
  }
  .spitup-banner-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .spitup-banner-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-on-dark);
  }
  .spitup-banner-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--forest-900);
    background: var(--amber-500);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .spitup-banner-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-on-dark-muted);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .spitup-banner-text strong {
    color: var(--text-on-dark);
  }
  .spitup-banner-cta {
    flex: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .spitup-banner-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .spitup-banner-cta {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
